_wei_Test_Review-45576\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202001171835332880486.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"4 stars out of 5\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Clubic\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>4 stars out of 5</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      In games, immersion is excellent and it is also very capable for music listening and its microphone is perfect.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>01/16/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta White Edition Media review Award of 4 stars out of 5\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.clubic.com/materiel-audio-hifi/casque-audio/article-882079-1-test-asus-rog-delta-white-edition-elegance-excellence-acoustique.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1352/202003201629184120180.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Design\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HARDWARE PLUS\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Design</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG Delta White Edition brings the gaming headset model, which is known and trusted with its unusually elegant white color, to a different point.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>Türkiye</span> <span>03/26/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta White Edition Media review Award of Design\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://hwp.com.tr/rog-delta-white-edition-inceleme-133778\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202009042235544860091.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"HITPOINT Sticker of Quality - Gold\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hitpoint.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>HITPOINT Sticker of Quality - Gold</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      At first glance, the headphones impress with design, the white variant is clearly more elegant than black. They perform acceptably in the area of ambient noise attenuation. As for the microphone, I have no choice but to take off my hat - the recorded sound is beautifully clear and the surrounding noise is completely deflected. The sound itself is clear and treble is great, but basses seems blurred to me, especially comparing to heights.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>05/01/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta White Edition Media review Award of HITPOINT Sticker of Quality - Gold\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://hitpoint.cz/recenze-white-edice-sluchatek-rog-delta/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/15640.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"BTech Quality\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      BTech\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>BTech Quality</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The sound is well segmented and the headphones are one of the better quality ones that were tested.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>02/29/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta White Edition Media review Award of BTech Quality\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://btech.rs/rog-delta-white-edition/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/2004/202004100525072470180.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"RUBY\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Streberi\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>RUBY</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Rog Delta is a  everything you would expect from a single headset and it is almost one step away from the perfection. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>REPUBLIC OF SERBIA</span> <span>02/06/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Delta White Edition Media review Award of RUBY\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.streberi.rs/testovi/slusalice-bez-mane-asus-rog-delta-white-editon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li 